    "detailed_description": "<strong>If you're looking for a Game that will change your life, you've come to the right place!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything was peaceful on Pixel Island until that dastardly Dr. E. Ville unleashed his Robots upon the land, now it's up to you to save the day!!!</h2><br><br>The Most Awesome Game Ever Made is a TOTALLY AMAZING Platformer with ABSOLUTELY INCREDIBLE 2D Side-Scrolling action!!<br><br>With the help of 11 Chunky Heroes, you'll Run, Jump, Fall, Slide, and Bounce into chaos-filled action. (Try to contain your excitement!!)<br><br><strong>This Game has everything!!!</strong><br>Robot Sharks? Check!<br>Balloon Bombs? Check!<br>...Killer Bananas? Checkaroo!<br><br><strong>GET ABOARD THE HYPE TRAIN!!! CHOO CHOO!!!!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Six EPIC Levels of Mayhem and Hilarity!<br></li><li>Hundreds of hours of replay value (if you literally have nothing else to do)<br></li><li>Intelligent(ish) AI<br></li><li>Tremendous Graphics, arguably indistinguishable from real-life.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Still not convinced? Then check out the genuine, definitely not made-up, quotes below...</h2><br><br><i>&quot;In my 106 years on this Earth, I have never felt greater joy and excitement, than in the 30 minutes I spent playing this Game.&quot;</i> - My Grandmother<br><br><i>&quot;A masterpiece, that filled the dark void I once had in my life.&quot;</i> - My 18-month old Niece<br><br><i>&quot;As an unbiased source, I rate this Platformer 5 Stars.&quot;</i> - The Developer<br><br><strong>What are you waiting for??? Download The Most Awesome Game Ever Made now!!!</strong>",
